title={globals, xenia} Options
desc=Options for all games
'Button Names
back=Back to Options
'Button Descriptions
logLevelDesc={globals, xenia} Log Levels:\n  - 0: Critical errors only\n  - 1: Critical errors and other warnings\n  - 2: Critical errors, warnings, and other info\n  - 3: Debugging info (Highly storage intensive)
xeniaFullscreen=Whether or not to launch {globals, Xenia} in {globals, fullscreen}.
consolidateSaves=When enabled, {globals, name} will consolidate {globals, xenia} data within\nthe Launcher's files. Uses storage temporarily until manually\ncleared. Must be {globals, enabled} to use the Manage Data window.
xeniaHeadless=When running Headless, {globals, xenia} will not show any prompts\nthat require user interaction, instead using default actions.
